# papita-proxmox-lab — Repository Map

Hybrid **Proxmox VE cluster + AWS** lab. On-prem PVE nodes connect to AWS (EFS shared storage) over **Tailscale**. Bash deploy scripts orchestrate node setup and Terraform; Python tooling is dev-only (Poetry + pre-commit).

## Architecture (high level)

```
Local workstation
  deploy/toolkit.sh ─┬─► deploy/proxmox.sh ──SSH──► PVE nodes (src/bash/setup-pve-node.sh)
                     └─► deploy/terraform.sh ──────► terraform/plans/ (S3 backend)
                                                          └─► hybrid_proxmox_aws_cluster
                                                                └─► aws/ (VPC, EFS, IAM)
```

